      ],
      "explanation": "Electron configuration of Mo(Molybdenum) = [Kr] 4d<sup>5</sup> 5s<sup>1</sup>. So it belongs to 4d series.\n<br><br/>Electron configuration of W(Tungsten) = [Xe] 4f<sup>14</sup> 5d<sup>4</sup> 6s<sup>2</sup>. So it belongs to 5d series.\n<br><br>Size of 3d &lt; 4d = 5d. Due to lanthanoid contraction size of 4d and 5d series elements are almost same.\n<br>"
